editor_description = "core/155: one stop of the Elevator (elevator.md, The shape), dropped by hand as a child of the Elevator at its floor's height with its floor set here. Origin: the floor, in the hatch's face plane across the opening's middle, facing +Z (the shaft behind). The hatch's Control (HATCH) is first, so the hatch's body is aimed through it; the Openable is driven by the Elevator's answers and kept open on a load; the Button's Control (BUTTON) calls the car, its aim body put on the Looks' button of this floor at ready."
